<title>MALAYSIA: RESEARCH ALERT - Renong started with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Renong started with buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it had started coverage of Malaysia's Renong Berhad with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a March 18 report, analyst Hatim Hoosenally said, &quot;Renong is trading at only half our estimate of its intrinsic value and this gap should narrow over the next two years, once returns surface on projects now in the development stage.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He set an 18-month price target of 7.40 ringgits a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed in Kuala Lumpur at 4.18 ringgits.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
